[b]p.changeName("John");[/b]
//Now p.name equals to "John"[/code]In the example above, we have defined a method named [b]changeName [/b]for our person, which is a function, that takes a parameter [b]name [/b]and assigns it to the [b]name [/b]property of the object. 
